          {
            "text": "Visual perception is core to autonomous driving safety."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": true,
        "level": 0,
        "font_size": 60,
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Adverse weather degrades detection; existing models lack efficiency or robustness."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": true,
        "level": 0,
        "font_size": 60,
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Key Challenge: Improve weather robustness while maintaining high inference efficiency."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "title": [
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": false,
        "level": 0,
        "font_size": 80,
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Proposed Method",
            "bold": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "textbox1": [
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": true,
        "level": 0,
        "font_size": 60,
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "ECL-YOLOv11 addresses robustness and real-time challenges in adverse weather conditions."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": true,
        "level": 0,
        "font_size": 60,
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Backbone integrates Edge-Enhancement Convolution using Sobel operators to preserve edge information."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": true,
        "level": 0,
        "font_size": 60,
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Neck employs Context-Guided Multi-Scale Fusion Network (AENet) for enhanced feature perception."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "textbox2": [
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": true,
        "level": 0,
        "font_size": 60,
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Head utilizes Lightweight Shared Convolution Detection Head to reduce redundant computations."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": true,
        "level": 0,
        "font_size": 60,
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Cross-scale parameter sharing and depthwise separable convolution improve inference efficiency."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": true,
        "level": 0,
        "font_size": 60,
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Three modules form an integrated architecture for edge preservation, context fusion, and optimization."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "title": [
      {
        "alignment": "left",
        "bullet": false,
        "level": 0,
